<title>UK: T&amp;N says Kolbenschmidt ruling imminent.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N says Kolbenschmidt ruling imminent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auto components engineer T&amp;N Plc said on Wednesday that it expected a German appeal court to give it the formal go-ahead this week to take a strategic stake in piston maker Kolbenschmidt AG.</p>
<p>But the British-based firm said it would not rush into exercising an option on 24.99 percent of Kolbenschmidt stake because it also expected the court to review a decision by Germany's cartel office to block a full bid.</p>
<p>&quot;I think we are expecting the final ruling literally today or tomorrow,&quot; chairman Colin Hope told Reuters.</p>
</text>
